{"title": "Greater Invisibility", "pageid": 7926, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Greater_Invisibility", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 4 Spells", "Illusion spells", "Spells that can be transcribed", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Greater_Invisibility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Greater_Invisibility.webp/300px-Greater_Invisibility.webp, /w/images/f/f5/Greater_Invisibility.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Greater_Invisibility.webp/300px-Greater_Invisibility.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f5/Greater_Invisibility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Greater Invisibility </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 4 illusion spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to provide a more resilient form of <a href=\"/wiki/Invisibility_(spell)\" title=\"Invisibility (spell)\">Invisibility</a> for their allies.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Turn a creature Invisible. Attacks against it have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a>. It attacks with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>. \n</p>\nInvisibility breaks when you fail increasingly harder <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stealth Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Checks</a> on attacking, casting spells, or interacting with items.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 4 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/38px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_Invisibility_Greater</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Invisibility_Greater\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Invisibility_Greater\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsConcentration_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsConcentration (spell flag)\">IsConcentration</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsMelee_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsMelee (spell flag)\">IsMelee</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Greater_Invisibility\"> Condition: Greater Invisibility </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Invisibility_(Condition)\" title=\"Greater Invisibility (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Greater Invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Greater_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Invisibility_(Condition)\" title=\"Greater Invisibility (Condition)\">Greater Invisibility</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Entity has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>. Attack Rolls against it have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a></li>\n<li>When interacting with items, casting spells, or attacking, the entity needs to succeed on a <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Check</a> to maintain Invisibility. The Check becomes harder with each successful attempt.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 7: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Land\" title=\"Circle of the Land\">Circle of the Land</a> (Underdark), <a href=\"/wiki/The_Archfey\" title=\"The Archfey\">The Archfey</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/The_Hexblade\" title=\"The Hexblade\">The Hexblade</a></li></ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a> with <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 4 Spell Slots</a> can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Greater_Invisibility\" title=\"Scroll of Greater Invisibility\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Scroll_of_Greater_Invisibility_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Greater_Invisibility_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Scroll_of_Greater_Invisibility_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Greater_Invisibility_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Scroll_of_Greater_Invisibility_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Greater_Invisibility_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Scroll_of_Greater_Invisibility_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Greater_Invisibility_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Scroll_of_Greater_Invisibility_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Greater_Invisibility\" title=\"Scroll of Greater Invisibility\">Scroll of Greater Invisibility</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> check <a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty_Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Difficulty Class\">Difficulty Class</a> for this spell starts at 15 and increases with the number of successes, with the exact scaling determined by difficulty:\n<ul><li>Outside of <a href=\"/wiki/Honour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour\">Honour</a> mode, the DC scales <i>linearly</i>: <span class=\"math\"><math class=\"mwe-math-element\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>DC</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>number of previous successful Stealth checks</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mstyle></mrow></math></span></li>\n<li>In Honour mode, the DC scales <i>quadratically</i>: <span class=\"math\"><math class=\"mwe-math-element\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>DC</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>number of previous successful Stealth checks</mtext></mrow><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mstyle></mrow></math></span></li></ul></li>\n<li>Actions with the <code><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Invisible (spell flag)\">Invisible</a></code> flag can be performed without this Stealth check. They also do not increase the Stealth check DC of subsequent actions.</li>\n<li>A hidden character who is out of combat can cast this spell on allies in combat without expending their action in this combat. While casting the spell is likely to render the caster unstealthed and add them into the initiative order, the caster still has their action in combat.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"Needs verification.\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Visuals\"> Visuals </span></h2>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper embedvideo--local-embed-style\" style=\"position: relative;\"><div class=\"embedvideo-localEmbedStyle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Play Video</div><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">Local File</div></div></div></div></div><video src=\"https://bg3.wiki/w/images/9/9d/Greater_Invisibility_Visuals.mp4\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 640px; height: auto;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Greater_Invisibility_Visuals.mp4\">https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Greater_Invisibility_Visuals.mp4</a></video></div></span> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Greater_invisibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Greater invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms